# Your Riot Games API key, from https://developer.riotgames.com — optional.
# With it the worker reads ranks from Riot directly; without it, from op.gg.
# A development key expires after 24 hours and has to be pasted in again; a
# personal API key does not. You can add or change it later under the worker's
# Settings → Variables and Secrets.
RIOT_API_KEY=
